  "description": "FUYDOV crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H64 Dy4 N16 O8 4+,4(Cl1 O4 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 4 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 4 O neighbors; Dy1C (Dy) has 4 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.774-3.774 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.23-109.88°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L1)4(μ2-OH)4]·4ClO4 (C60H64Cl4Dy4N16O28). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
